<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#08285f"><title>Finalizar compra | SIWEPE</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="../assets/img/siwepe-mark.png"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../assets/css/commerce.css?v=20260813.1">
</head>
<body>
  <svg class="commerce-sprite" aria-hidden="true"><symbol id="c-check" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m5 12 4 4L19 6"/></symbol><symbol id="c-truck" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 6h11v11H3zM14 10h4l3 3v4h-7z"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2"/></symbol><symbol id="c-card" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2" y="5" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M2 10h20"/></symbol><symbol id="c-bank" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m3 9 9-6 9 6M5 10v8M9 10v8M15 10v8M19 10v8M3 21h18"/></symbol><symbol id="c-lock" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"/></symbol><symbol id="c-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"/></symbol><symbol id="c-upload" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 16V3m-5 5 5-5 5 5M4 15v5h16v-5"/></symbol></svg>
  <header class="commerce-header"><div class="commerce-header-inner"><a class="commerce-brand" href="../index.html"><img src="../assets/img/siwepe-mark.png" alt=""><strong>SIWEPE</strong></a><span class="brand-separator"></span><a class="store-brand" id="store-link" href="tienda.html"><span id="store-logo">T</span><strong id="store-name">Tienda</strong></a><span class="secure-header"><svg><use href="#c-lock"/></svg>Checkout seguro</span></div></header>
  <main class="commerce-main checkout-main" id="checkout-main">
    <nav class="crumbs"><a id="back-cart" href="carrito.html">Carrito</a><span>/</span><strong>Envío y pago</strong></nav>
    <div class="checkout-steps"><div class="done"><span><svg><use href="#c-check"/></svg></span><b>Carrito</b></div><i></i><div class="current"><span><svg><use href="#c-truck"/></svg></span><b>Envío y pago</b></div><i></i><div><span>3</span><b>Confirmación</b></div></div>
    <section class="checkout-title"><span class="commerce-eyebrow">ÚLTIMO PASO</span><h1>Completá tu compra</h1><p>Confirmá quién recibe, dónde entregamos y cómo vas a pagar.</p></section>
    <div class="checkout-layout">
      <form class="checkout-form" id="checkout-form">
        <section class="checkout-card"><div class="checkout-card-title"><span><svg><use href="#c-truck"/></svg></span><div><h2>Dirección de entrega</h2><p>Estos datos quedarán guardados en la orden.</p></div></div><label class="checkout-field full"><span>Dirección guardada</span><select id="delivery-saved"><option value="">Escribir una dirección</option></select></label><div class="checkout-grid"><label class="checkout-field"><span>Nombre completo *</span><input id="delivery-name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120"></label><label class="checkout-field"><span>Teléfono *</span><input id="delivery-phone" autocomplete="tel" required maxlength="30"></label><label class="checkout-field full"><span>Dirección exacta *</span><textarea id="delivery-address" autocomplete="street-address" required maxlength="180" placeholder="Colonia, calle, bloque, casa y referencia"></textarea></label><label class="checkout-field"><span>Ciudad *</span><input id="delivery-city" autocomplete="address-level2" required maxlength="80"></label><label class="checkout-field"><span>Departamento / Estado *</span><input id="delivery-state" autocomplete="address-level1" required maxlength="80"></label></div><label class="save-address"><input type="checkbox" id="save-address"><span>Guardar esta dirección en mi perfil</span></label></section>
        <section class="checkout-card"><div class="checkout-card-title"><span><svg><use href="#c-card"/></svg></span><div><h2>Método de pago</h2><p>Elegí la opción disponible que prefieras.</p></div></div><div class="payment-options"><label class="payment-option active"><input type="radio" name="payment" value="transferencia" checked><span><svg><use href="#c-bank"/></svg></span><div><strong>Transferencia bancaria</strong><small>Subí el comprobante para que la tienda valide el pago.</small></div><b></b></label><label class="payment-option"><input type="radio" name="payment" value="tarjeta"><span><svg><use href="#c-card"/></svg></span><div><strong>Tarjeta</strong><small>Los datos sensibles no se almacenan en SIWEPE.</small></div><b></b></label></div><div id="transfer-panel" class="payment-panel"><div id="bank-data" class="bank-data"></div><label class="proof-uploader" id="proof-uploader"><input id="proof-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" hidden><span><svg><use href="#c-upload"/></svg></span><strong>Subir comprobante</strong><small>JPG, PNG o WEBP · máximo 6 MB</small></label></div><div id="card-panel" class="payment-panel" hidden><div class="payment-warning">La tarjeta se valida para preparar la orden, pero esta instalación local aún necesita conectar una pasarela de cobro para debitarla. SIWEPE nunca guarda el número ni el CVV.</div><div class="checkout-grid"><label class="checkout-field full"><span>Nombre en la tarjeta *</span><input id="card-name" autocomplete="cc-name" maxlength="80"></label><label class="checkout-field full"><span>Número de tarjeta *</span><input id="card-number" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="cc-number" maxlength="23" placeholder="0000 0000 0000 0000"></label><label class="checkout-field"><span>Vencimiento *</span><input id="card-expiry" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="cc-exp" maxlength="5" placeholder="MM/AA"></label><label class="checkout-field"><span>CVV *</span><input id="card-cvv" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="cc-csc" maxlength="4" placeholder="•••"></label></div></div><label class="checkout-field full order-note-field"><span>Nota para la tienda (opcional)</span><textarea id="order-note" maxlength="500" placeholder="Ej: envolver para regalo, llamar antes de entregar…"></textarea></label></section>
      </form>
      <aside class="summary-card checkout-summary"><div class="summary-head"><span>Tu pedido</span><b id="checkout-count">0 artículos</b></div><div id="checkout-items" class="checkout-items"></div><div class="summary-row"><span>Subtotal</span><strong id="checkout-subtotal">L 0.00</strong></div><div class="summary-row muted"><span>Envío</span><span>A coordinar</span></div><div class="summary-total"><span>Total</span><strong id="checkout-total">L 0.00</strong></div><button class="commerce-primary" id="confirm-order" form="checkout-form">Confirmar pedido <span>→</span></button><div class="summary-legal"><svg><use href="#c-lock"/></svg><span>Al confirmar aceptás los <a href="terminos.html">términos y condiciones</a>.</span></div></aside>
    </div>
  </main>
  <section class="confirmation" id="confirmation" hidden></section><section class="checkout-gate" id="checkout-gate" hidden><img src="../assets/img/siwepe-mark.png" alt=""><span class="commerce-eyebrow">CUENTA SIWEPE</span><h1>Inicia sesión para terminar tu compra</h1><p>Tu carrito está guardado. Después de ingresar volverás directamente al checkout.</p><button class="commerce-primary" id="gate-login">Iniciar sesión</button><a id="gate-cart" href="carrito.html">Volver al carrito</a></section>
  <div class="commerce-toast" id="commerce-toast" role="status"></div>
  <script src="../assets/js/shared/data.js?v=20260820.1"></script><script src="../assets/js/commerce/checkout.js?v=20260813.1"></script>
</body></html>
